n输出一行 JSON：\n{\"checkpoint_exists\": true/false, \"checkpoint_path\": \"完整路径\", \"adapter_config_ok\": true/false, \"adapter_model_size_bytes\": 数字, \"all_checkpoints\": [\"列表\"], \"verdict\": \"USABLE 或 BROKEN 或 MISSING\"}"
